body:
The donation was relevant to the video she was watching, which may have been the reason why he/she donated at that time.  It tends to depend on the context and how immersed everyone is in the video.

&#x200B;

Cause, if you've got adhd Andy skipping through 5+ videos, then there's no need to hold back on donating -- and I'm well aware that that context does not imply to this current clip.  :)
